§ `F11 the limit on the search for a day that is not a day of rest`

-- The search for a day that is not a day of rest stops after 400 days in Vic and in ACT.
-- The input below is a run of 450 consecutive public holidays that begins on 3 March 2025 and covers the whole day.
GIVEN start IS A DATE
      count IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `A public holiday`
`a run of public holidays` start count MEANS
    IF count AT MOST 0
    THEN EMPTY
    ELSE (`A public holiday` OF start, FALSE) FOLLOWED BY (`a run of public holidays` (start PLUS 1) (count MINUS 1))

-- Cth
#ASSERT (`the latest day on which a thing may be done` Cth `anything else` (Date 3 3 2025) (`Days of rest and closure` OF (`a run of public holidays` (Date 3 3 2025) 450), EMPTY, EMPTY, EMPTY)) EQUALS (JUST (Date 27 5 2026))
#ASSERT (`the latest day on which a thing may be done` Cth `anything else` (Date 6 4 2026) (`Days of rest and closure` OF (`a run of public holidays` (Date 3 3 2025) 450), EMPTY, EMPTY, EMPTY)) EQUALS (JUST (Date 27 5 2026))
#ASSERT (`the latest day on which a thing may be done` Cth `anything else` (Date 7 4 2026) (`Days of rest and closure` OF (`a run of public holidays` (Date 3 3 2025) 450), EMPTY, EMPTY, EMPTY)) EQUALS (JUST (Date 27 5 2026))
-- NSW
#ASSERT (`the latest day on which a thing may be done` NSW `anything else` (Date 3 3 2025) (`Days of rest and closure` OF (`a run of public holidays` (Date 3 3 2025) 450), EMPTY, EMPTY, EMPTY)) EQUALS (JUST (Date 27 5 2026))
#ASSERT (`the latest day on which a thing may be done` NSW `anything else` (Date 6 4 2026) (`Days of rest and closure` OF (`a run of public holidays` (Date 3 3 2025) 450), EMPTY, EMPTY, EMPTY)) EQUALS (JUST (Date 27 5 2026))
#ASSERT (`the latest day on which a thing may be done` NSW `anything else` (Date 7 4 2026) (`Days of rest and closure` OF (`a run of public holidays` (Date 3 3 2025) 450), EMPTY, EMPTY, EMPTY)) EQUALS (JUST (Date 27 5 2026))
-- Vic
